      "fact": "Ebola cases are spreading in eastern Democratic Republic of Congo. It is caused by Bundibugyo virus, has also spread to Uganda, and has been declared a public health emergency of international concern. A patient with the virus was admitted to a hospital in Berlin, Germany. The World Health Organization assesses the risk of global spread as low, though risk remains high at national and regional levels.",
